docs {
  Public profile questions smoke flow.

  User A owns the answers configured by this folder. The counterpart token is only used for the visual-profile read against profile_questions_visual_match_id.

  Required environment variables:
  - profile_questions_user_a_id_token
  - profile_questions_counterpart_id_token
  - profile_questions_visual_match_id

  Run in order:
  10 Get Profile Question Catalog
  20 Upsert User A Answer 1
  21 Upsert User A Answer 2
  22 Upsert User A Answer 3
  23 Upsert User A Unselected Answer 4
  30 Select User A Public Questions
  31 Get User A Private Answers
  32 Reorder User A Public Questions
  33 Replace One Selected Question
  34 Get User A Private Answers After Selection Change
  40 Get User A Visual Profile As Existing Counterpart
  50 Delete Selected User A Answer
  51 Confirm Selection Compacted
}
